00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:21.460
A plan of action or policy designed to achieve a major or overall aim.

00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:22.960
Yeah, I got nothing.

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:25.960
All right, we were looking for what is strategy.

