00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:04.980
Yeah. It's a bagel.

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:07.020
Where is New Delhi?

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:09.320
Yeah, I'm so against Wordle.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:13.540
