00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:16.560
but $72,400.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:21.760
Praise be. Hey man, like, don't, don't pigeonhole us.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:27.240
I can like football and, and asking questions as answers.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:31.180
I think I'd rather see fake money than see a fake car.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:37.880
