00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:13.480
is a chore to watch, let alone play.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:23.040
So I don't think this belongs on the essential games list because it's definitely not like what people think of like peak video games, let alone peak game shows.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.700
